WEBVTT

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:03.629
over time it is highly likely that you

00:00:01.949 --> 00:00:06.750
will generate quite a lot of fails and

00:00:03.629 --> 00:00:08.700
fall us on your computer the most modern

00:00:06.750 --> 00:00:10.980
computers this isn't an issue as you

00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:13.769
