00:00:56.910 --> 00:01:01.530
quickly move up there and that is then

00:00:58.949 --> 00:01:03.690
compress that folder so just to see how

00:01:01.530 --> 00:01:06.630
much it has compressed it by I can

00:01:03.690 --> 00:01:09.540
highlight the itq folder and select get

00:01:06.630 --> 00:01:11.700
