00:01:16.229 --> 00:01:24.090
zip file and select get info and that

00:01:20.520 --> 00:01:26.610
will lend give me the information on

00:01:24.090 --> 00:01:28.680
that which is 1.5 megabyte which may not

00:01:26.610 --> 00:01:30.840
seem much but if you bear in mind that

